    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641090/extras/9632e3144f0f59d40723d7dcfb845929.avif?t=1747094794\" width=548 height=160 /></span>The old Hermit knows things but has a curious question that must be answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641090/extras/266db4408695eca5f5fd40fc8069ac90.avif?t=1747094794\" width=548 height=160 /></span>Test your mind and knowledge by solving puzzles while threatened by intense hordes of vermin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641090/extras/8667fe64b7a4bc84b7254305df66f04c.avif?t=1747094794\" width=548 height=160 /></span>Knowledge is power.  Find and collect abilities that can be used to destroy threats and break puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An explorative dungeon puzzle adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore Dungeon Puzzles that will test your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Puzzles while exterminating hordes of threatening vermin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve area specific puzzle styles in a multitude of player chosen ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique areas with specific puzzle mechanics tailored to that area</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Abilities that alter gameplay in different ways </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Health Upgrades to resist against the hordes of vermin</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641090/extras/9632e3144f0f59d40723d7dcfb845929.avif?t=1747094794\" width=548 height=160 /></span>The old Hermit knows things but has a curious question that must be answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641090/extras/266db4408695eca5f5fd40fc8069ac90.avif?t=1747094794\" width=548 height=160 /></span>Test your mind and knowledge by solving puzzles while threatened by intense hordes of vermin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2641090/extras/8667fe64b7a4bc84b7254305df66f04c.avif?t=1747094794\" width=548 height=160 /></span>Knowledge is power.  Find and collect abilities that can be used to destroy threats and break puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An explorative dungeon puzzle adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore Dungeon Puzzles that will test your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Puzzles while exterminating hordes of threatening vermin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve area specific puzzle styles in a multitude of player chosen ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique areas with specific puzzle mechanics tailored to that area</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Abilities that alter gameplay in different ways </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Health Upgrades to resist against the hordes of vermin</p>",
